      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00469",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“今天我是斥候长。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Today I am the chief scout.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00470",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "小孩这样说着，穿过杜鹃花丛向下边跑去。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Saying this, the child ran down through the azalea bushes.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00470",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "那只狗也卷起尾巴，追着小孩跑了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The dog also curled up its tail and ran after the child.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00470",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "过了一会儿，两三个年龄相仿的孩子，也朝着那个方向跑去了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After a little while, two or three children of about the same age also ran off in that direction.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kokoro-zh-p00471",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "1.斥候：古代的侦察兵。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "1. Scout: a reconnaissance soldier in ancient times.",
